00:17:43,890 --> 00:17:47,060
- Wait a minute. We can't do this.     - Why?

256
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:50,610
I don't want to know what Monica got me.

257
00:17:50,810 --> 00:17:54,570
I'm sure she worked hard at getting it and wanting to surprise me.

258
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:56,780
And you guys are gonna ruin that.

259
00:17:57,030 --> 00:18:00,360
We have to put them back. This isn't what Christmas is about.

260
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,830
Whatever, Linus. I'm opening mine.

261
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:10,000
Nobody is opening anything, okay?

262
00:18:10,290 --> 00:18:14,000
I want to see the look on her face when I give her my present.

263
00:18:14,250 --> 00:18:17,760
I'm sure she wants to see the look on my face when I get mine.

264
00:18:18,010 --> 00:18:21,800
So, please, please, can we just? Can we put them back?

265
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:25,220
- Will you get us better gifts?     - Fine.

266
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:28,980
Hey, guys.

267
00:18:31,150 --> 00:18:32,690
You found the presents?

268
00:18:33,190 --> 00:18:35,110
You let them find the presents?

269
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:36,320
Great.

270
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:40,450
Do you know how long it took me to find you that water purifier?

271
00:18:41,370 --> 00:18:44,990
- That's what you got me?     - Yes, I see. That look is priceless.

272
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:53,790
Home sweet home, huh?

273
00:18:54,630 --> 00:18:57,670
Nice to, uh, get back to reality.

274
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:02,970
Plus, we, uh, know how the New Year's gonna go off.

275
00:19:03,390 --> 00:19:06,760
I guess there's no reason for all that Y2K panic, you know?

276
00:19:08,730 --> 00:19:10,480
Anyway, good night.

277
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:12,980
- Joey?     - Yeah?

278
00:19:15,570 --> 00:19:16,940
3...
Three...

279
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,440
2 , 1
two, one.

280
00:19:26,950 --> 00:19:28,370
Happy New Year.

281
00:19:33,210 --> 00:19:34,750
What was that for?

282
00:19:35,250 --> 00:19:38,420
Tonight when they yelled "cut" and we didn't get to kiss...

283
00:19:38,630 --> 00:19:42,590
I was really, really disappointed, and I just...

284
00:19:43,090 --> 00:19:45,090
I just really wanted to kiss you.

285
00:19:45,550 --> 00:19:46,970
Really?

286
00:19:48,430 --> 00:19:52,440
In the moment, I really wanted to kiss you too. In the moment.

287
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:55,350
- In the moment.     - But only in the moment.

288
00:19:57,480 --> 00:20:01,610
So do you, uh, want to kiss again?

289
00:20:02,450 --> 00:20:05,530
Sure. New Year's Eve is only two weeks away.

290
00:20:05,950 --> 00:20:06,990
Can you wait?

291
00:20:07,450 --> 00:20:08,870
No.

292
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:11,950
Me neither.

293
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:17,920
3 , 2...
Three, two...

294
00:20:18,170 --> 00:20:20,460
You don't have to count down every time we kiss.

295
00:20:20,710 --> 00:20:22,630
Oh. Okay.

296
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:28,680
Except I sort of felt like I needed a couple seconds to get ready.

297
00:20:52,410 --> 00:20:55,920
We were on the platform, ready to dance into the new millennium...

298
00:20:56,120 --> 00:20:58,830
and the guy yells "cut!"

299
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:02,840
So you guys are telling me that you actually did...

300
00:21:03,090 --> 00:21:05,510
the routine from eighth grade?

301
00:21:06,010 --> 00:21:09,600
Yeah! But of course we had to update it a little bit.

302
00:21:09,850 --> 00:21:12,810
Hey, by the way, quick thinking about catching me.

303
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:16,690
There's no way you could've done the end...

304
00:21:16,940 --> 00:21:19,310
the way you guys did it back then.

305
00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:23,780
What? We could do it.

306
00:21:24,030 --> 00:21:28,990
I don't know. You were a lot bigger... I mean, stronger back then.

307
00:21:30,910 --> 00:21:32,540
I can do it, okay?

308
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:35,330
Come on, let's go! Come on.

309
00:21:36,580 --> 00:21:38,290
l , 2 , 3 , 4
One, two, three, four...

310
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:41,090
5 , 6 , 7 , 8
five, six, seven, eight.

311
00:21:41,340 --> 00:21:42,500
- I can't do it!     - Ahh!

312
00:21:45,170 --> 00:21:48,470
Now, you do that, you're on TV.

